- Other workers share /Users/me/dev/angles/warp; don't edit files there. Commit through a private index: GIT_INDEX_FILE=probes/impl-traits.index git read-tree <parent>; git update-index --add --cacheinfo 100644,$(git hash-object -w <copy file>),<path>; git commit-tree; git push origin "${commit}:refs/heads/impl-traits" (in zsh write ${commit}, because $commit:r is a modifier). Small focused conventional commits (feature(minor)/feature(major)/fix/test/chore), no Co-Authored-By / Claude-Session / session links.
